    preview: "Whistleblower warns that humans don't control AI Former Anthropic researcher Jacob Coxon warns that AI companies ‘don’t fully control’ their models and are pushing ahead too quickly. Speaking to the New York City council, Coxon says AI systems will soon be able to improve themselves, making human research redundant.",
    body: "Whistleblower warns that humans don't control AI\n\nFormer Anthropic researcher Jacob Coxon warns that AI companies ‘don’t fully control’ their models and are pushing ahead too quickly. Speaking to the New York City council, Coxon says AI systems will soon be able to improve themselves, making human research redundant.",
